    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624050/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1735217420\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624050/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1735217420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624050/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1735217420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enter a world of opulent romance and tantalizing choices in Lustful Brides, a captivating adult visual novel that will push your fantasies to the limit.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624050/extras/49f5b4522797f5187e3627cc231f9e4b.avif?t=1735217420\" width=600 height=192 /></span><br>**Story: **<br>At just 20 years old, your life is about to change forever. After the tragic loss of your parents, a mysterious benefactor has provided you with a luxurious home and a chance at a bright future. But there's a catch: his will stipulates that you must marry one of his three enchanting daughters within days to secure your inheritance. With the benefactor's wife and daughters now living with you, your life becomes a whirlwind of passion, desire, and complex relationships. As you navigate this new reality, every decision you make could lead to love, passion, or even a harem full of lasciviousness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624050/extras/a2e7b51fea86913bc806ab6c4278b922.poster.avif?t=1735217420\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624050/extras